      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Holy Crow Arts and SFU Indigenous Studies invites you to a special screening and panel discussion of    HONOR THY MOTHER    A documentary project of the Indipino Community of Bainbridge Island     Documentary Screening and Panel, Thursday, September 25th     Reception: 5PM | Welcome &amp; S"
